{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":22.72},{"sectionId":"build","start":24.12,"end":47.36},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":48.96,"end":61.36}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":1.68,"text":"互動除了改變畫面，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":1.8,"end":3.04,"text":"也應揭露狀態。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.76,"end":6.48,"text":"最後一段程式會在啟動後，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.64,"end":9.2,"text":"把聯絡按鈕標示為已展開。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.88,"end":18.2,"text":"檢查整件作品：標題順序、窄螢幕版面、可見焦點與可讀的聯絡回饋。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":18.64,"end":20.08,"text":"下載工作區檔案，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":20.32,"end":22.72,"text":"即可保留完整靜態網站。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":24.12,"end":25.36,"text":"在 /accessibility."},{"sectionId":"build","start":25.627,"end":29.04,"text":"js 的初始 setAttribute 呼叫中，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":29.44,"end":32.96,"text":"把錯誤的展開狀態 true 改為 false。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":33.84,"end":37.44,"text":"接著用 Tab 移到按鈕、按 Enter，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":38.24,"end":39.68,"text":"檢查狀態變為 true。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":40.56,"end":42.32,"text":"一起匯出五個檔案。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":44.16,"end":47.36,"text":"什麼最能證明按鈕可用鍵盤操作？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":48.96,"end":52.48,"text":"什麼最能證明按鈕可用鍵盤操作？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":53.84,"end":57.92,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":58.72,"end":61.36,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}